{"id": "P1", "source_run": "sim-r4", "at": "2026-11-17T20:56:45+0800", "situation": "競爭者網域首頁是運動或資訊內容，但 sitemap 有一個佔約一半網址的資料夾，內容是大量商業關鍵字（品牌名加意圖後綴）頁；需要判斷關鍵字頁規模、是否模板化、導流目標是否一致，以及網域是否由舊站改用途。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：build 後 search 指定關鍵字並把 limit 開到最大，因為預設只列少數樣本，要看完整後綴清單。\n2. inspect_page：讀列表頁與多個內容頁的 H1、H2、FAQ、JSON-LD 型別與 og 日期，因為多頁比對才能分辨結構相同或內文也相同。\n3. inspect_page：每個品牌頁各用 part=links 加 link_filter 篩推廣網域，因為要確認連結是否都導向同一個外部網域。\n4. wayback：timeline 後 snapshot 轉址前最後正常存檔，並搭配 domain_info，因為註冊日只代表最近一次註冊。", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0130", "E-0131", "E-0103", "E-0110", "E-0132", "E-0114", "E-0140"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0103"], "call_n": 5}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0110"], "call_n": 9}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20251108182921id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114"], "call_n": 12}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0130"], "call_n": 16}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0131"], "call_n": 17}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/富遊娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0132"], "call_n": 18}]}
